{"id":"n72239-6-9","stage":1,"title":"누르다 · 呆","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72239-6-9-1","ko":"요즘 어떻게 지내니?","zh":"最近过得怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지내니?","meaning":"度日，生活","explanation":"지내다：度日，生活；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"1","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"度日，生活","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3","entryId":"17173","definition":"以某种程度或状态过日子。","pronunciation":["지ː내다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a64d8970e72cd40c5909.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72239-6-9-2","ko":"그냥 집에 눌러 있으면서 일자리를 알아보고 있어.","zh":"我就待在家里，同时也在找工作。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그냥","meaning":"随便","explanation":"그냥：随便","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"4","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"눌러","meaning":"呆","explanation":"누르다：呆；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"누르다","audio":"/audio/aaaee287bf5aed197d56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72239","senseId":"6","lemma":"누르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있으면서","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；으면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일자리를","meaning":"工作，岗位","explanation":"일자리：工作，岗位；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일자리","audio":"/audio/b5f09931e50d69eebb47.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24568","senseId":"1","lemma":"일자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알아보고","meaning":"打听，了解，查询","explanation":"알아보다：打听，了解，查询；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"알아보다","audio":"/audio/1d2b64ddd329540a6838.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16080","senseId":"1","lemma":"알아보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"随便","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"没有任何想法或别意地。","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"aaaee287bf5aed19","term":"누르다","zh":"呆","audio":"/audio/aaaee287bf5aed197d56.mp3","entryId":"72239","definition":"持续留在某处。","pronunciation":["누ː르다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"b5f09931e50d69ee","term":"일자리","zh":"工作，岗位","audio":"/audio/b5f09931e50d69eebb47.mp3","entryId":"24568","definition":"工作岗位或单位等作为职业工作的地方。","pronunciation":["일ː짜리"]},{"id":"1d2b64ddd329540a","term":"알아보다","zh":"打听，了解，查询","audio":"/audio/1d2b64ddd329540a6838.mp3","entryId":"16080","definition":"为了知道本不知道的东西而查看或调查。","pronunciation":["아라보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1db2cc97e14e3b4a8f84.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.398,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72239","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"6","sourceLevel":"초급","day":46,"sequenceScore":2.0514,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["最近过得怎么样？","我就待在家里，同时也在找工作。","我到底做错了什么啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["最近过得怎么样？","我就待在家里，同时也在找工作。","我到底做错了什么啊？"],"answer":1}]}
